From c039b232e5fcf181ac4d16b9231cdc42a025d45c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: satoru akita <wwlap24@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:43:20 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] system/wg: add runtime WireGuard configuration and
 recoverable file saves

Configure the kernel device through its pointer-free ioctl ABI. Keep private keys in the configuration file, propagate persistence failures, reserve a recovery copy before VFS replacement, and support public-key derivation without reading keys back from the driver.
---
